Z||000009||RNGCRSH||03-11-2001||12:07 PM||||JohnnyK,<P>@home does use a proxy:<P>you can find it under: tools&gt;internet options&gt;connections&gt;lansettings if you are using IE <P>I dont use the proxy. but they have had me turn it on before "http://:8080" is the address and check : use automatic configuration script<P>If it is turned on then try unchecking the box<P>hope this helps<p>[This message has been edited by RNGCRSH (edited 03-11-2001).]||||reg||1
